Binary blobs for the Intel S1200KP mainboard must be extracted from the OEM
firmware image. From the repository root, run:

  ./S1200KP_BIOS/extract_s1200kp_blobs.sh [path/to/W25Q32BV_s1200kp.bin]

The script will populate this directory with descriptor.bin, me.bin, and
gbe.bin for the board before building coreboot.
